# Everything under videos/ is source footage or derived samples - none of it belongs in
# git. The whole directory is ignored rather than pattern-matched: `videos/*.srt` only
# matched the top level, so the 6.7 MB of telemetry in videos/compressed_source/ was
# still stageable by an `git add -A`.
videos/
runs/
static/
# Generated by web/export_data.py - regenerate with `python web/export_data.py`, don't commit
# (JSON payloads up to ~17MB, plus transcoded clips). The source of truth is videos/samples/.
web/data/
web/clips/
kaggle/*/output/
kaggle/*/output_v*/

# Cached Esri basemap tiles - regenerate with `python -m pipeline.fetch_tiles`.
# Not redistributed here: the imagery is Esri/Maxar licensed, ours only to cache locally.
web/tiles/

# Submission bundles and downloaded model weights - both rebuildable, neither belongs in git.
*.zip
*.pt
